cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Real-Time Deepfake Artifact Detector"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Neves
    given-names: Magne Dina
    alias: KRYPTON0078
    affiliation: University of Macau
repository-code: "https://github.com/KRYPTON0078/realtime-deepfake-artifact-detector"
url: "https://github.com/KRYPTON0078/realtime-deepfake-artifact-detector"
abstract: >-
  A research demo that scores face-swap style spatial artifacts in webcam,
  phone-camera, and uploaded video using YuNet face detection, a MobileNetV2
  classifier with a heuristic fallback, and hysteresis temporal smoothing.
  It does not claim general detection of all modern generative video models.
keywords:
  - deepfake detection
  - face-swap artifacts
  - media forensics
  - computer vision
  - MobileNetV2
  - YuNet
  - trustworthy AI
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-08"
